<title>USA: U.S. weekly railcar loadings-wk ended Nov 2--AAR.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly railcar loadings-wk ended Nov 2--AAR.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Association of American Railroads reported weekly railcar loadings as follows:</p>
<p>    -		Pct Change   Week Ending:	   Year-Ago</p>
<p>    -		   In Week---11/02/96  10/26/96     Week</p>
<p> Grain		     4.1	30,398    29,191    27,098</p>
<p> Grain Mill Products   0.9	10,001     9,910     9,391</p>
<p> Other Farm Products -24.1	 1,840     2,424     2,533</p>
<p> Metallic Ores	   5.9	17,843    16,849    17,599</p>
